## Licensing (RAW files & datasets)

Every recording is available for commercial licensing as a RAW source file
(WAV up to 192 kHz / 32-bit float; 4K and 8K 360° video) with documented
place, date, weather and gear. Curated collections (e.g. Polish forest
ambience, rain, rivers) can be licensed as datasets for AI/ML training.
Details: https://naturesoundstherapy.github.io/licensing.html
Contact: nstfieldrec@gmail.com

